---
pageKey: applications
---
{#- The call for applications, on its own URL. The selected groups live on the Soubory page; this
    page never lists them, it only says when the selection comes (in the call intro). Once the call
    closes, swap the two inMenu flags in content/pages.yaml – see the comment there. -#}
{%- set callShown = edition.ageMin and edition.status == 'upcoming' -%}
<section class="wrap section page-head">
  <div class="page-head-text">
    <h1>{{ registry.title | t(lang) }} {{ edition.year }}</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="page-head-logo" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/{{ edition.logo.color }}" alt="" width="300" height="300" fetchpriority="high">
  </div>
</section>
{% include "partials/call.njk" %}
{%- if not callShown %}
<section class="wrap section">
  <p class="notice">{{ db.copy.call.closed | t(lang) }}</p>
</section>
{%- endif %}
